  "description": {
   "text": "Simulacrum\n(Illusion/Phantasm)\n\nLevel: 8\nRange: 0\nDuration: 1 round/level\nCasting Time: 9\nArea of Effect: Special\nSaving Throw: None\n\nA duplicate of the caster is created with this spell. The duplicate is almost identical to the caster, making it a very powerful ally. It is created at 60% of the caster's level and has all the spells that the caster would have at that level. Of the caster's special abilities it keeps those that its class and kit give at that level, as often as that level gives them, and no more uses than the caster had left; abilities from items, quests or anything else are lost. It cannot use quick-slot items. It also has 60% of the caster's Hit Points and is fully under <PRO_HISHER> control.",
